      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This seems so unnecessary and unfounded. A process for submitting DMCA takedown notices already exists. VRChat says to terminate repeat infringers per [Copyright Policy](https://hello.vrchat.com/copyright) and DMCA (17 U.S. Code § 512)'s requirement on terminating repeat infringers. And as stated in that policy:\n\n> These requests may only be sent in by the copyright owner or an agent authorized to act on the owner’s behalf.\n\nNothing will happen until you copyright holders submit claims of infringement, because copyright holders have the power to decide what's authorized.\n\nFollow the legal process.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
