  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm an avatar creator and have seen a bunch of my avatars uploaded as public when it goes against my TOS. I want to report them but there isn't a good category for it... and with ripping being such a MASSIVE problem I think it would be incredibly valuable for staff to be able to see if there are repeat offenders and, dare I say, have punishments for them.",
